{"id":"af4f7551b0885593","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-self-reference.md","title":"Self-Reference","display":"df-self-reference — Self-Reference","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-self-reference","aliases":["90-df-self-reference"],"display":"df-self-reference — Self-Reference","depends_on":["[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-godel-number]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-self-reference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-self-reference</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-self-reference — Self-Reference"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e705f7962c302c2\" href=\"?note=5e705f7962c302c2\" title=\"90-df-godel-number\">90-df-godel-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 和编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner=g(\\sigma)\">\\(\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner=g(\\sigma)\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5e705f7962c302c2\" href=\"?note=5e705f7962c302c2\" title=\"90-df-godel-number\">90-df-godel-number</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\">\\(\\varphi(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\\)</span> 是指定自由变量的数码代入，不是将公式当作集合论函数调用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (fixed arithmetical signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory satisfying the diagonal-lemma assumptions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T\\)</span> (fixed-point relation, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T(\\psi;\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T(\\psi;\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对角引理断言：对每个合适的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v)\">\\(\\varphi(v)\\)</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T(\\psi;\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T(\\psi;\\varphi)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>自指是相对于编码、理论和所表达性质的固定点关系，不是未加说明的“句子直接包含自己”。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-number","status":"resolved","id":"5e705f7962c302c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-number","status":"resolved","id":"5e705f7962c302c2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$、$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 和编码 $g$；$\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner=g(\\sigma)$ 直接取 [[90-df-godel-number]]，$\\vdash$ 直接取 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]。$\\varphi(\\overline{g(\\psi)})$ 是指定自由变量的数码代入，不是将公式当作集合论函数调用。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$、$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 和编码 $g$；$\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner=g(\\sigma)$ 直接取 [[90-df-godel-number]]，$\\vdash$ 直接取 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]。$\\varphi(\\overline{g(\\psi)})$ 是指定自由变量的数码代入，不是将公式当作集合论函数调用。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}$ (formula, see [[90-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (sentence, see [[90-df-sentence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner=g(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\overline{g(\\psi)})","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T(\\psi;\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T(\\psi;\\varphi)","display":false}],"bytes":1561,"backlinks":[{"id":"6763f8a85fa6a7b0","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是依赖具体编码的“字面提及自身数码”概念，与 [[90-df-self-reference]] 的可证固定点概念不同；字面出现本身并不蕴含任何指定的可证双条件。"},{"id":"23106efbc02dddf0","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"把给定 $\\varphi(v)$ 代入 [[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]，再用 [[90-df-self-reference]] 的定义重写其双条件，即得结论。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-self-reference]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df